<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c4" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Combat Rogue</span></h2>World Drops once served a purpose, but with the combination of The Timeless Isle and Celestial Dungeons, they're not worth the gold spent to acquire them.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-celestial-court">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c4" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pet_tigergodcub.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Celestial Court</span></h3>Chi-Ji, Yu'Lon, Xuen, and Niuzao all share a loot pool, and drop iLvl 553 Tier 16, as well as iLvl 550 Prideful Gladiator's gear.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99113/gloves-of-the-barbed-assassin">
<img alt="Gloves of the Barbed Assassin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_leather_raidrogue_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Barbed Assassin</span></a></div></li></ul>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102663/prideful-gladiators-leather-gloves">
<img alt="Prideful Gladiator's Leather Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_leather_pvprogue_g_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Prideful Gladiator's Leather Gloves</span></a></div></li></ul>Killing these World Bosses will be great for bumping your iLvl up a bit from your Throne of Thunder gear, if you're lucky enough to acquire it!<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
