<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c4" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_staff_2h_pandarenmonk_c_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Timeless Isle Items for Combat Rogue</span></h2>The Timeless Isle in Phase 5 is great for catching up on gear.  You will earn <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a> for almost all activities that you participate in.<br/>
<br/>The Timeless Isle has a decent catch-up trinket <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103986/discipline-of-xuen">
<img alt="Discipline of Xuen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_tigergodcub.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Discipline of Xuen</span></a>, though Celestials offer better trinkets. You can also acquire Timeless Armor Pieces for Chest, Helm, Belt, Legs, and Bracers. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104012/timeless-leather-armor-cache">
<img alt="Timeless Leather Armor Cache" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Leather Armor Cache</span></a> can be turned into gear <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=101867/cranefeather-jerkin">
<img alt="Cranefeather Jerkin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cranefeather Jerkin</span></a>, which can be upgraded to 535 iLvl by using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103982/burden-of-eternity">
<img alt="Burden of Eternity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_monk_envelopingmist.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burden of Eternity</span></a>. Though the armor pieces from Celestials have a higher iLvl when upgraded. Lastly, you can also acquire an ILvl 496 Dagger, Fist Weapon, Cloak, and Jewelry. <br/>
<br/>
